# Locked Decisions (delta)

Finalized decisions not owned by another rule. Do not contradict without explicit user approval.

## Service taxonomy (locked categories)

| Category | Definition |
|---|---|
| **Services** | People-hours — ongoing or project (Setup, Hire a Developer, Customization, Maintenance, Consultation, Founder's Track) |
| **Solutions (Done-For-You)** | Scoped, done-for-you outcomes — the 61+ implementations |
| **Tools** | Productized software, self-serve |
| **Themes** | Design templates |

Keep the four distinct — never blur Solutions into "Tools" in customer-facing copy.

## Three-tier offer pattern (locked)

Setup and Dedicated-Developer offers present as:

**Free (Zoom Clinics) → Popular (paid) → Apply-only (premium).**

## Do NOT resurrect (killed decisions)

| Killed | Why |
|---|---|
| `/welcome` page | Homepage does the job |
| `/api-docs` | Not an API company |
| `/changelog` | Not that kind of product |
| `/press` | Build when there's press |
| `/careers` | Lives on BusinessLabs.org |
| WhatsApp as a public CTA | Internal channel only |
| "$100 free credits" offer | Replaced by free Zoom Clinics |
| BDAutomate as a separate brand | Deferred until tools earn independent revenue |

